# Licensing

`circuit-compiler` is licensed under **GPL-3.0** because it links
[`iden3/circom`](https://github.com/iden3/circom) (GPLv3).

* *Status:* The compiler is a build-time tool only.

* *No Contamination:* It is not compiled into the project's runtime binaries or
  distributed application artifacts. Its GPLv3 terms do not extend to the
  Apache-2.0 source in `circuits/` or the generated `.r1cs`/key artifacts
  themselves (those are governed separately; see `circuits/LICENSE`).

See `circuits/COPYING` for the full GPL-3.0 license text.
